_7Xrv6rGJmZ3BZSJFL3bMWTguwflt65tfXGg7XykcNRy0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTr8UPEGBN5l7JBHG3LvlEm8qD7wzHWBkZ23jnOJqJcIg&oe=6B045FF2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1036448793422084", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138838_1570418616610271_304446665_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SOf6IkSifmkQ7kNvwHpMzEK&_nc_oc=AdoRvvayQ8aLH2SqY2h9RDctSUNlh44GTw4h9F5XEor2utOQzSopHqZsxFMh9l8nyH4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRr9YyqwvrFIOTE_3ZJjL9GXDV_kJn0gM7V_SQHrBcBMg&oe=6B04690B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Circumpaint", "keywords": ["paint", "animate", "images"], "long_description": "Do you like to draw? How about animate? Now you can do both while surrounded by a 360 degree view of your art. Circumpaint allows you to paint with pixels on a hemispherical canvas with you at the center. And when you're ready you can move beyond stills using page flip style animation. Uses the touchpad, or use a gamepad to access shortcuts.\n\n\"I ended up animating a pixel dragon breathing fire, it was silly but cute. It made me laugh and want to play a bit more. The developer clearly understand the limitations of trying to paint with your head, I appreciate the choices that they made to deliver a surprisingly satisfactory experience.\"\n-- Brad Herman, Head of DreamLab at DreamWorks Animation\n", "short_description": "Do you like to draw? How about animate? Circumpaint allows you to paint with pixels on a hemispherical canvas with you at the center. And when you're ready you can move beyond stills using page flip style animation. Uses the touchpad, or use a gamepad to access shortcuts.\n\n\"I ended up animating a pixel dragon breathing fire, it was silly but cute. It made me laugh and want to play a bit more.\"\n-- Brad Herman, Head of DreamLab at DreamWorks Animation\n"}]}, "developer_name":